{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自此以來總明申破，\n從此已去別斥四宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自在既爾，七計例然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此王弼舊疏，以無為為道體"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此梁武帝新義，用\n佛經以真空為道體"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "周弘政、張機並斥老有雙非之義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓋是道士用三洞、靈寶等經立義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此山有石，堪作灰。此部\n住彼山中修道，故以為名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丁巳"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001002", "type": "mod", "text": "蕀【大】，棘【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001003", "type": "mod", "text": "矣【大】，矣問曰【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0001004", "type": "mod", "text": "問曰【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0002001", "type": "mod", "text": "即【大】，則【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0002002", "type": "mod", "text": "棲【大】，期【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0002003", "type": "mod", "text": "諂【大】＊，謟【甲】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0002004", "type": "mod", "text": "因【大】，目【甲】"}
